  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nepali Yuwa in Climate Action and Green Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action will promote the involvement of young nepali people in green growth, environmental protection and combating climate change. It will provide opportunities for youth to participate in local and provincial government and provide a platform to harness their skills through entrepreneurship</narrative>
  </description>
